{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udff7\ufe0f Short Description</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Dungeon Brawl</i> is a casual-yet-intense online co-op roguelike action game! Choose from dozens of anime-style heroes, freely combine hundreds of skills and relics, and team up with your friends to carve through hordes of enemies. Build your own fighting style and dive into the blood-soaked chaos!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udded About This Game</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc7e Anime Heroes \u00d7 Roguelike Builds \u00d7 Hack &amp; Slash Action</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Dungeon Brawl</strong> \u2014 a fast-paced, anime-style co-op roguelike that combines the <strong>skillful controls of MOBAs</strong> with <strong>deep build crafting mechanics</strong>. Every run is a new adventure, every battle a chaotic thrill!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udca5 A New Challenge Every Run!</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of <strong>stylized anime heroes</strong> with unique skills and personalities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hundreds of skills</strong> to mix and match \u2014 unlock synergies, evolve combos, and build your own battle rhythm</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect <strong>hundreds of randomized relics and gear</strong> every run to customize your build</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep strategy meets fast-paced action \u2014 showcase your creativity every time you play</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921540/extras/6abbe65ed8a95599def4f027c0ec643f.poster.avif?t=1765767524\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921540/extras/6abbe65ed8a95599def4f027c0ec643f.webm?t=1765767524\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921540/extras/6abbe65ed8a95599def4f027c0ec643f.mp4?t=1765767524\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\uddd9 Diverse Playstyles \u2014 Your Build, Your Way!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From brawlers to mages, summoners to tanks, you\u2019ll find your flow in <i>Dungeon Brawl</i>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Physical</strong>: Dash in and slash your enemies into pieces</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Spellcaster</strong>: Unleash powerful AoE and elemental blasts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728 <strong>Effect-heavy</strong>: Stack poison, burn, and shock for massive damage over time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f <strong>Tank/Defense</strong>: Soak up hits, protect teammates</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc7b <strong>Summoner</strong>: Command minions to fight for you</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc09 <strong>Transformation</strong>: Morph into powerful creatures and wreak havoc</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921540/extras/dba09cc702e5300170547d3f32b1e36d.poster.avif?t=1765767524\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921540/extras/dba09cc702e5300170547d3f32b1e36d.webm?t=1765767524\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921540/extras/dba09cc702e5300170547d3f32b1e36d.mp4?t=1765767524\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shar